# Prescribed-subside support for QuadWild-BiMDF (042, Route A): pinned subdivision counts
# (input_rem_p0.fixed sidecar), prescribed boundary placement via per-subside split fractions
# honored in computeQuadrangulation's chart-UV mapping, and prescribed rims pinned through the
# post-solve smoothing.
# Apply from the quadwild-bimdf checkout root:
#   git apply --directory=. quadwild-prescribed-subsides.patch   (main tree hunks)
#   git -C libs/satsuma apply quadwild-prescribed-subsides-satsuma.patch

